{# Example Jinja2 template for custom Gitleaks reports #}
{# This template demonstrates how to create custom report formats #}

==========================================
    GITLEAKS SECURITY SCAN REPORT
==========================================

Scan Summary:
-------------
Total Findings: {{ findings|length }}
{% if findings %}
Severity: HIGH - Secrets detected!
{% else %}
Severity: NONE - No secrets found.
{% endif %}

{% if findings %}
==========================================
    DETAILED FINDINGS
==========================================

{% for finding in findings %}
Finding #{{ loop.index }}
----------------------------------------
Rule ID:      {{ finding.RuleID }}
Description:  {{ finding.Description }}
File:         {{ finding.File }}
Line:         {{ finding.StartLine }}
{% if finding.Commit %}
Commit:       {{ finding.Commit }}
{% endif %}

Match:        {{ finding.Match }}
{% if finding.Secret != finding.Match %}
Secret:       {{ finding.Secret }}
{% endif %}

{% if finding.Tags %}
Tags:         {{ finding.Tags|join(", ") }}
{% endif %}

{% if finding.Entropy %}
Entropy:      {{ "%.2f"|format(finding.Entropy) }}
{% endif %}

Fingerprint:  {{ finding.Fingerprint }}

{% endfor %}
{% else %}
==========================================
    ✓ NO SECRETS DETECTED
==========================================

Your code appears to be clean of hardcoded secrets.
Continue to follow security best practices!

{% endif %}

==========================================
    RECOMMENDATIONS
==========================================

{% if findings %}
1. Remove hardcoded secrets from your codebase
2. Use environment variables or secret management systems
3. Rotate any exposed credentials immediately
4. Review git history for leaked secrets
5. Consider using pre-commit hooks to prevent future leaks
{% else %}
1. Continue using Gitleaks in your CI/CD pipeline
2. Set up pre-commit hooks for automatic scanning
3. Regularly audit your codebase for security issues
4. Keep your secret detection rules up to date
{% endif %}

==========================================
    Generated by Gitleaks Python
==========================================
